{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Friendship can be earned with ",["l","鹈鹕镇","Pelican Town"],"'s ",["l","居民","villagers"],". As friendships deepen, the villagers' dialogue lines become more friendly, cut-scenes called heart events occur, villagers are more likely to send gifts in the mail, and ",["l","婚姻","marriage"]," is possible with one of the ",["l","居民","datable villagers"],"."]]]],["Friendship mechanics",2,[]],["Point system",3,[["p",["Each villager has a friendship score represented by a ten-heart meter, except the player's ",["l","婚姻","spouse"]," or ",["l","科罗布斯","roommate"],", who has a fourteen-heart meter. If a villager is a marriage candidate, the last two hearts will be greyed out meaning it is capped at 8 hearts instead of 10 until the player has given them a ",["l","花束","bouquet"],"."]],["p",["Each heart is 250 friendship points. All heart meters can be viewed on the social tab of the game menu."]],["p",["When talking to villagers, a circle will appear next to their portrait. Its color will depend on the number of hearts the player has with the villager. Blue denotes 0-1 hearts, green for 2-3, yellow for 4-5, red for 6-7, purple for 8-9, and at 10-14 hearts a purple star will appear. Hovering the mouse over the circle will display the number of hearts out of 10, if not married."]],["p",["Friendship points can be increased with each villager by:"]],["l",0,[[1,["talking to them once per day (+20)"]],[1,["completing an item delivery ",["l","任务","quest"]," (+150)"]],[1,["giving a gift they love, like, or are neutral towards (see Gifts)"]],[1,["giving the maximum two gifts in one week (+10, awarded on the next Sunday)"]],[1,["inviting them to the ",["l","电影院","Movie Theater"]," (+200 if loved, +100 if liked)"]],[1,["purchasing a snack for them at the Movie Theater (+50 if loved, +25 if liked) (see ",["l","电影院","Movie Theater"],")"]],[1,["making certain choices in heart events"]],[1,["kissing your spouse (+10, only for the first kiss of the day); does not apply if ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]," is your roommate"]]]],["p",["Friendship points can be decreased by:"]],["l",0,[[1,["not giving a daily greeting (see Decay)"]],[1,["giving a gift they dislike or hate (see Gifts)"]],[1,["hitting them with a ",["l","武器","slingshot"]," (-30 per hit)"]],[1,["making certain choices in heart events"]],[1,["rummaging through a ",["l","垃圾桶","Garbage Can"]," when they're within 7 tiles of the player (-25, except ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"]," who increases: +5). They will speak to indicate that they have seen them. If more than one villager is within 7 tiles of the player when they rummage, only one will speak and lose friendship."]]]],["p",["If a player has read ",["l","交友导论","Friendship 101"],", all friendship gains are increased by 10%."]],["p",["For the player's spouse, all friendship gains and losses are reduced by 34%."]],["p",["The player may enter a villager's bedroom when the relevant heart meter reads at least 2 hearts. This level improves access to the villager for talking and gifting. Once opened, the room is permanently unlocked even if the heart meter goes below 2 hearts."]],["p",["Friendship points can increase up to a maximum of 2749 (one point less than 11 hearts) for non-marriage candidates."]],["p",["With marriage candidates, the meter pauses at 8 hearts. It will not increase unless you give the candidate a ",["l","花束","bouquet"]," to indicate your romantic interest. If you do so, that meter is unlocked and operates as before until ten hearts is reached. (Note that after reaching 8 hearts pre-bouquet, friendship points can continue to rise to just below 9 hearts (2249 points) and will not decay until the candidate is given a bouquet.) It is possible to give a bouquet to any and all marriage candidates, and raise all their friendship levels to 10 hearts, without damage to your relationships with other romantic partners, so long as you have not yet proposed. (If you have proposed, are married, or have a roommate, there is a chance your fiancé/spouse/roommate may become ",["l","婚姻","jealous"],".) ",["l","枯萎的花束","Breaking up with them"]," will instantly lower the relationship meter to 5 hearts, but it can be increased back to 8 hearts."]],["p",["Dating all bachelors or bachelorettes may result in a ",["l","花束","Group Ten Heart event"],", which does not affect friendship, but may prevent the player from giving gifts to them for one week afterwards."]],["p",["After proposing marriage, the heart meters of all other marriage candidates revert to their pre-engagement behavior. However, their entries in the social tab still show whether they have previously been given a bouquet. In addition, after marriage, romantic heart events can still be triggered with other marriage candidates if they have previously been given a bouquet. After the marriage ceremony, the player's spouse's meter unlocks once again and can rise as far as 14 hearts. Friendship points can then increase up to a maximum of 3749 (one point less than 15 hearts)."]]]],["Decay",3,[["p",["Each day, not talking to a villager will slightly decrease their friendship unless their heart meter is full. If the player is married, decay never stops with their spouse even if the player is at 14 hearts with them. Calling a villager using the ",["l","电话","Telephone"]," does not count as talking to the villager."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Relationship"]},{"h":1,"v":["Decay rate"]},{"h":1,"v":["When decay stops"]}],[["Married"],["-20/day"],["Never"]],[["Gave ",["l","花束","bouquet"]],["-10/day"],["10 hearts"]],[["Pre-bouquet"],["-2/day"],["8 hearts"]],[["Not romanceable"],["-2/day"],["10 hearts"]]]]]],["Gifts",3,[["p",["You can give each villager one gift per day, up to two gifts per week, as indicated by the checkboxes in the social tab. You can review the villager's gift preferences by clicking on their row in the Social Tab to open the \"Gift Log\". This log keeps track of gifts given, and gift preferences learned via ",["l","秘密纸条","Secret Notes"]," and dialogues with their family and friends. Any previously-given gifts that are currently in ",["l","物品栏","inventory"]," will have a blue backpack icon in the lower right."]],["p",["For the purpose of gift-giving, the week begins on Sunday. If you give a villager two gifts in a week, their heart meter will rise by an additional 10 friendship points on Sunday morning when you wake up."]],["p",["You can always give a birthday gift to a villager, even if you've already given them two other gifts that week."]],["p",["You can give your spouse one gift every day of the week, but any friendship gain or loss is halved."]],["p",["Each villager has individual likes and dislikes, which affects how many friendship points are gained or lost when you give them a gift. The friendship points are multiplied on their birthday (×8) and ",["l","冬日星盛宴","Feast of the Winter Star secret gifting event"]," (×5):"]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Gift Taste"]},{"h":1,"v":["Normal"]},{"h":1,"v":["Winter Star (×5)"]},{"h":1,"v":["Birthday (×8)"]}],[["Love"],["+80"],["+400"],["+640"]],[["Like"],["+45"],["+225"],["+360"]],[["Neutral"],["+20"],["+100"],["+160"]],[["Dislike"],["-20"],["-100"],["-160"]],[["Hate"],["-40"],["-200"],["-320"]]]],["p",["If a gift is liked or loved, the points gained will be further affected by the quality of the item:"]],["t",[[{"c":2,"h":1,"v":["Quality"]},{"h":1,"v":["Multiplier"]},{"h":1,"v":["Effect"]}],[[],["Normal"],["×1"],["+0%"]],[[],["Silver"],["×1.1"],["+10%"]],[[],["Gold"],["×1.25"],["+25%"]],[[],["Iridium"],["×1.5"],["+50%"]]]],["p",["On any given day, gifting a normal quality loved item always gives more points than gifting an iridium quality liked item to a given villager."]],["p",["For liked or loved gifts, the equation is Event Multiplier × Preference × Quality Multiplier, where Event Multiplier is 1 (any day), 5 (the player's ",["l","冬日星盛宴","Winter Star"]," recipient), or 8 (their birthday), Preference is 80 (loved gifts) or 45 (liked gifts), and Quality Multiplier is 1, 1.1, 1.25, or 1.5. (For neutral, disliked, or hated gifts, the equation is simply Event Multiplier × Preference.) The highest friendship points possible from a single gift would be to gift someone an iridium-quality loved gift on their birthday, which would yield 960 points, just short of 4 hearts. If the player has read ",["l","交友导论","Friendship 101"],", the highest friendship points would be (960 * 1.1) 1056 points, just over 4 hearts."]]]],["Gift Preference Dialogues",4,[["p",["If the player's friendship level with a villager is at least 1 heart, the villager may display a dialogue about a gift that is hated or loved by a family member or friend. Shown below is a collapsable table of all family and friends for whom a villager may show a gift preference dialogue. Villagers not included in the table will never show a gift preference dialogue."]],["t",[[{"r":2,"h":1,"v":["Villager"]},{"c":2,"h":1,"v":["May display dialogue for:"]}],[{"h":1,"v":["Family"]},{"h":1,"v":["Non-family"]}],[[["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"]],[["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"],["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"]],[]],[[["l","亚历克斯","Alex"]],[["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"],["l","乔治","George"]],[]],[[["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"]],[["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"]],[]],[[["l","克林特","Clint"]],[],[["l","艾米丽","Emily"]]],[[["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"]],[["l","罗宾","Robin"],["l","玛鲁","Maru"]],[]],[[["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"]],[],[["l","威利","Willy"]]],[[["l","艾米丽","Emily"]],[["l","海莉","Haley"]],[]],[[["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"]],[["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],["l","乔治","George"]],[]],[[["l","乔治","George"]],[["l","亚历克斯","Alex"],["l","艾芙琳","Evelyn"]],[]],[[["l","格斯","Gus"]],[],[["l","潘姆","Pam"]]],[[["l","海莉","Haley"]],[["l","艾米丽","Emily"]],[]],[[["l","贾斯","Jas"]],[],[["l","文森特","Vincent"]]],[[["l","乔迪","Jodi"]],[["l","肯特","Kent"],["l","山姆","Sam"],["l","文森特","Vincent"]],[]],[[["l","肯特","Kent"]],[["l","乔迪","Jodi"],["l","山姆","Sam"],["l","文森特","Vincent"]],[]],[[["l","刘易斯","Lewis"]],[],[["l","玛妮","Marnie"]]],[[["l","玛妮","Marnie"]],[["l","贾斯","Jas"],["l","谢恩","Shane"]],[["l","刘易斯","Lewis"]]],[[["l","玛鲁","Maru"]],[["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],["l","罗宾","Robin"],["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"]],[]],[[["l","潘姆","Pam"]],[["l","潘妮","Penny"]],[["l","格斯","Gus"]]],[[["l","潘妮","Penny"]],[["l","潘姆","Pam"],"\n(Note that Penny will never suggest ",["l","啤酒","Beer"],", ",["l","蜜蜂酒","Mead"],", ",["l","淡啤酒","Pale Ale"],", or ",["l","果酒","Wine"],")"],[]],[[["l","皮埃尔","Pierre"]],[["l","阿比盖尔","Abigail"],["l","卡洛琳","Caroline"]],[]],[[["l","罗宾","Robin"]],[["l","德米特里厄斯","Demetrius"],["l","玛鲁","Maru"],["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"]],[]],[[["l","山姆","Sam"]],[["l","乔迪","Jodi"],["l","肯特","Kent"],["l","文森特","Vincent"]],[["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"]]],[[["l","桑迪","Sandy"]],[],[["l","艾米丽","Emily"]]],[[["l","塞巴斯蒂安","Sebastian"]],[["l","玛鲁","Maru"],["l","罗宾","Robin"]],[["l","山姆","Sam"]]],[[["l","谢恩","Shane"]],[["l","玛妮","Marnie"]],[]],[[["l","文森特","Vincent"]],[],[["l","贾斯","Jas"]]],[[["l","威利","Willy"]],[],[["l","艾利欧特","Elliott"]]]]],["p",["Note that ",["l","石头","stone"]," may be included in a gift preference dialogue, despite the fact that it is disliked, not hated."]]]],["Heart Events",3,[["p",["Gaining friendship with each ",["l","居民","villager"]," will unlock unique events (see each villager's article for the requirements). It's possible to permanently miss some events, though most events can be viewed anytime (with some time restrictions) or out of order. In some heart events, it is not possible to increase or decrease friendship with anyone, even if dialogue choices are available. However, in certain heart events, making certain choices can either increase or decrease friendship with certain villagers involved. The maximum possible friendship points that can be earned in one single heart event is +250 from ",["l","莱纳斯","Linus"],"' 8 heart event, while the maximum possible friendship points that can be lost is -1500 from ",["l","潘妮","Penny"],"'s 8 heart and 10 heart events."]]]],["Romance",3,[["n",["Main article: ",["l","婚姻","Marriage"]]],["p",["Some villagers can be romanced by the player (see ",["l","居民","marriage candidates"],"). Once the player has reached eight hearts with an eligible villager, the player can give them a ",["l","花束","bouquet"]," to unlock the ninth and tenth hearts. Once the player has reached ten hearts with an eligible ",["l","居民","villager"],", the player can give them a ",["l","美人鱼吊坠","Mermaid's Pendant"]," to propose marriage, which the villager will always accept unless the player hasn't upgraded the farmhouse to at least Level 2. Alternatively, at 10 hearts, the player can give ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"]," a ",["l","虚空幽灵吊坠","Void Ghost Pendant"]," to indicate they'd like to move in together as roommates, which Krobus will always accept unless the player hasn't upgraded the farmhouse to at least Level 2."]],["p",["After becoming the player's spouse or roommate, the villager moves into the player's house and their friendship meter expands to fourteen hearts. After reaching 12.5 hearts (3125 points), the villager will give the player a ",["l","星之果实","stardrop"]," if the player has not received a stardrop in this manner previously."]]]],["Quests",3,[["n",["Main article: ",["l","任务","Quests"]]],["p",["The game-opening ",["l","任务","Introductions quest"],", when completed, increases by 100 the player's friendship points with each of the 28 starting ",["l","居民","townspeople"],". (The ",["l","法师","Wizard"]," is not included among these villagers.)"]],["p",["Some ",["l","任务","Story Quests"]," and ",["l","任务","Special Order Quests"]," will raise friendship with certain villagers."]],["p",["Completing an ",["l","任务","Item Delivery Quest"]," awards 150 friendship points with the requesting villager."]]]],["Festivals",3,[["n",["Main article: ",["l","节日","Festivals"]]],["p",["20 friendship points are earned for speaking to villagers at festivals, the same as any non-festival day. Three festivals can have special effects on friendship points with villagers:"]],["l",0,[[1,["The ",["l","花舞节","Flower Dance"]," increases friendship by 250 points (one heart) with the player's dance partner."]],[1,["The ",["l","夏威夷宴会","Luau"]," can increase or decrease friendship points with all villagers except ",["l","桑迪","Sandy"],", the ",["l","法师","Wizard"],", ",["l","科罗布斯","Krobus"],", and the ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"],". This depends on the ingredient that was added to the soup."]],[1,["The player's gift to their secret friend at the ",["l","冬日星盛宴","Feast of the Winter Star"]," is worth 5x the normal amount of friendship points."]]]],["p",["In addition, giving gifts to villagers at the ",["l","夜市","Night Market"]," will increase friendship with them, in the same way as it does outside of festivals."]]]],["Bulletin Board Bundles",3,[["n",["Main article: ",["l","收集包","Bundles"]]],["p",["Completing all ",["l","收集包","Bulletin Board bundles"]," improves the player's ",["l","友谊","friendship"]," rating with ",["l","居民","non-datable villagers"]," by two hearts (500 points). Note that this applies only to non-datable villagers whom you have met in person. Villagers who do not show on the \"Social\" tab of the player menu and villagers whose names appear as \"???\" will not receive 500 points."]],["p",["The player does not have to understand ",["l","矮人语教程","Dwarvish"]," for the ",["l","矮人","Dwarf"]," to receive 500 points. In contrast, they do have to understand Dwarvish for gifts to affect friendship with the Dwarf."]]]],["Universal Gifts",2,[["p",["See also: ",["l","礼物列表","List of All Gifts"]]],["p",["Below are lists of items that are universally loved, liked, considered neutral, disliked, or hated. Note that there are some exceptions and that individual ",["l","居民","villager"]," tastes override any universal tastes.\nPreferences for Eggs, Milk, ",["l","水果","Fruit"],", and most ",["l","采集","Foraged Items"]," vary by ",["l","居民","villager"],", and are generally not listed here."]],["p",["Note that ",["l","恐龙蛋","Dinosaur Egg"],"s are considered ",["l","古物","Artifacts"]," and not Eggs for gifting purposes."]]]],["Universal Loves",3,[["p",["This is a list of items that almost every ",["l","居民","villager"]," loves to receive as a gift. These items are guaranteed to give the most points (80) towards your relationship, but may be difficult to obtain."]],["p",["When given a loved gift, villagers usually respond with a heart dialogue bubble."]],["l",0,[[1,[["i","(O)373","Golden Pumpkin"]]],[1,[["i","(O)279","Magic Rock Candy"]]],[1,[["i","(O)797","Pearl"]]],[1,[["i","(O)74","Prismatic Shard"]]],[1,[["i","(O)446","Rabbit's Foot"]]],[1,[["i","(O)StardropTea","Stardrop Tea"]]]]],["p",["Note: ",["l","星之果茶","Stardrop Tea"]," grants 250 friendship points (equal to one full heart) when given to any villager, and is not subjected to the weekly gift limit. If given on a villager's birthday or at the ",["l","冬日星盛宴","Feast of the Winter Star"],", it gives 750 points (3 hearts). It does not count for the \"",["l","任务","Qi's Kindness"],"\" Special Order."]]]],["Universal Loves exceptions",4,[["l",0,[[1,[["l","海莉","Haley"]," hates ",["l","五彩碎片","Prismatic Shard"],"."]],[1,[["l","潘妮","Penny"]," hates ",["l","兔子的脚","Rabbit's Foot"],"."]]]]]],["Universal Likes",3,[["p",["Though worth fewer friendship points than a loved gift, a liked gift increases friendship by 45 points (just over half that of a loved gift) and is often much easier to obtain."]],["l",0,[[1,[["l","工匠物品","All Artisan Goods"]," (Except for ",["l","油","Oil"],", which is universally disliked; and ",["l","虚空蛋黄酱","Void Mayonnaise"],", which is universally hated, except by Krobus who loves Void Mayonnaise.)"]],[1,[["l","烹饪","All Cooking"]," (Except for ",["l","煎鸡蛋","Fried Egg"]," and ",["l","面包","Bread"],", which are universally neutral; and ",["l","奇怪的小面包","Strange Bun"]," and ",["l","海泡布丁","Seafoam Pudding"],", which are universally hated.)"]],[1,[["l","花","All Flowers"]," (Except for ",["l","虞美人花","Poppy"],", which is universally hated.)"]],[1,[["l","矿物","All Foraged Minerals"]," (Except ",["l","石英","Quartz"],", which varies by villager.)"]],[1